176
00:08:00.428 --> 00:08:02.061
You don't send Fury
to voicemail.

177
00:08:02.063 --> 00:08:03.294
They're calling me.

178
00:08:03.296 --> 00:08:05.097
- I gotta go.
- You gotta talk to him.

179
00:08:05.099 --> 00:08:07.967
I'm gonna call him. I promise.
I'm gonna call him. I will.

180
00:08:07.969 --> 00:08:09.934
